  "effectiveDate": "2017-06-28",
  "historyNote": "#9319-A, eff 11-12-08 (from Fire 201.21); ss by #12225-A, eff 6-28-17 (formerly Fire 201.23) (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Fire 200)",
